      "text": "🎭 Character Sheet\n\nThe Recruiter (Hero)\nA mid-30s recruiter, professional but slightly overwhelmed. Sitting at a desk with laptop, notes, and multiple candidate profiles. Focused, busy, juggling too many calls.\n\nKeep the Recruiter visually consistent in all panels.\n\n🧩 Panels\nPanel 1\n\nThe Recruiter sits at their desk looking at a long list of candidates on screen.\nCaption:\n“These candidates need to be screened…”\n\nPanel 2\n\nThey’re on a call, while more candidate notifications/messages pile up on screen.\nCaption:\n“…but I don’t have time to call them all.”\n\nPanel 3\n\nA calendar or task list showing hours blocked out for calls, looking overwhelming.\nCaption:\n“It takes hours just to get through the list.”\n\nPanel 4\n\nThe Recruiter leans back slightly frustrated, some candidates still untouched.\nCaption:\n“And good candidates slip through.”\n\nPanel 5\n\nSimple interface showing automated outbound calls running and responses being captured.\nCaption:\n“Frontly calls and screens every candidate for you.”\n\nPanel 6\n\nDashboard showing a clean shortlist of top candidates with structured responses.\nCaption:\n“Get a shortlist of the best candidates in minutes.”\n\nPanel 7 (CTA Panel)\n\nClean branded panel with simple UI + logo.\nCaption:\n“More conversations. Better candidates. Less busy work.”"
